      "date": "2026-02-09T01:06:10.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.21 (vs ₹0.33 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.21 (down from ₹0.33 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹20.5m (down 15% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹3.25m (down 38% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 16% (down from 22% in 3Q 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 24% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 1% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
